  "contentHtml": "<P>\r\n<TABLE border=0 cellSpacing=0 cellPadding=0 width=\"100%\">\r\n<TBODY>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=30 width=100 align=center><IMG src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/relay/cafe/original/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fsedu21.com%2Fimages%2Fbrd_name.gif\"></TD>\r\n<TD bgColor=#ededed width=1></TD>\r\n<TD align=center>김영학</TD>\r\n<TD bgColor=#ededed width=1></TD>\r\n<TD height=30 width=100 align=center><IMG src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/relay/cafe/original/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fsedu21.com%2Fimages%2Fbrd_date.gif\"></TD>\r\n<TD bgColor=#ededed width=1></TD>\r\n<TD width=100 align=center>2010-02-06</TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>Children's Discovery Museum&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>기념품 가게에 갔다가 얻은 아이디어 입니다.<BR><BR><BR>1. 돼지 저금통의 불편한 점은?<BR><BR>2. 예를 들어 저금통에 넣은 돈중에서 일부는 저금을 하고, 나머지는 기부금으로 사용하고 싶다.<BR><BR>3. 어떻게 저금통을 만들면 될까? 설계해보기<BR></P>\r\n<P><BR>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/25463D4652D2618721\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"501\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"501\"  id=\"A_25463D4652D261872187C7\"/></P>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<P><BR>이렇게 구획을 나누면 되는군요!<BR><BR>4. 그럼 기부금만 어떻게 꺼낼까? <BR><BR><BR><BR><BR></P>\r\n<P><BR>발바닥 4개가 보이시죠?<BR><BR></P>\r\n<P><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2678684652D2618611\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"501\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"501\"  id=\"A_2678684652D2618611CC1D\"/><BR></P>\r\n<P><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2631BE4652D2618528\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"501\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"501\"  id=\"A_2631BE4652D2618528F718\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>수업용 ppt자료 첨부합니다.</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DIYj%26dataid%3D1%26fileid%3D4%26regdt%3D2014011